- fixed video thumbnail squaring
- improved video player and ui
- added multiple folders to library and library exclusions
- added in:, path:, and other path search operators
  - search operator reference is in the search type dropdown
- added file tree (experimental)
- sped up video scanning by skipping deep metadata probing

This is a big refactor, if there are problems you should revert to the old one and delete your database
MacOS: Open finder Cmd+Shift+G, type `~/Library/Application Support/nicegal`, delete the folder
Linux: Delete `.config/nicegal`
Windows: Win+R, type %APPDATA%, delete `nicegal`
